{"id":"3807ab351b0011c6","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-reduced-product.md","title":"Reduced Product","display":"df-reduced-product — Reduced Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-reduced-product","aliases":["17-df-reduced-product"],"display":"df-reduced-product — Reduced Product","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-filter]]","[[17-ax-zfc]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; quotient well-definedness locally checked","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"set quotient; Definition 4.1.6; Propositions 4.1.5 and 4.1.7","source_pages_print":[214,215,216],"source_pages_djvu":[230,231,232],"legacy_label":"17-df-4.2.1b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-reduced-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-reduced-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reduced-product — Reduced Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; quotient well-definedness locally checked"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"set quotient; Definition 4.1.6; Propositions 4.1.5 and 4.1.7"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>214</span><span>215</span><span>216</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span><span>231</span><span>232</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.2.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为一阶语言，符号分量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V)\\)</span> 的参数依次是输出集合、载体族、指标集、载体族的目标集合（陪域），见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,V,P,\\sim_D,[f]_D,Q_D\">\\(\\mathcal A,V,P,\\sim_D,[f]_D,Q_D\\)</span> 是下式定义的对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in P\">\\(f,g\\in P\\)</span> 时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\sim_Dg\">\\(f\\sim_Dg\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_D\">\\([f]_D\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 为候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构。以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\\)</span>，元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar f\\in P^n\">\\(\\bar f\\in P^n\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个分量记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar f(j)\">\\(\\bar f(j)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,|\\mathfrak A_i|):i\\in I\\},\\qquad\nV\\coloneqq\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\\right),\\\\\nP&amp;=\\{f:I\\to\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|:\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in|\\mathfrak A_i|)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V),\\\\\nf\\sim_Dg&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in D,\\\\\n[f]_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g\\in P:f\\sim_Dg\\},\\qquad\nQ_D\\coloneqq P/{\\sim_D}\\coloneqq\\{[f]_D:f\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\land|\\mathfrak B|=Q_D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;\nc^{\\mathfrak B}=[\\,i\\mapsto c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\,]_D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad F^{\\mathfrak B}(([\\bar f(j)]_D)_{j&lt;n})\n=[\\,i\\mapsto F^{\\mathfrak A_i}((\\bar f(j)(i))_{j&lt;n})\\,]_D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl((([\\bar f(j)]_D)_{j&lt;n})\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:((\\bar f(j)(i))_{j&lt;n})\\in R^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\}\\in D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,|\\mathfrak A_i|):i\\in I\\},\\qquad\nV\\coloneqq\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\\right),\\\\\nP&amp;=\\{f:I\\to\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|:\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in|\\mathfrak A_i|)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V),\\\\\nf\\sim_Dg&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in D,\\\\\n[f]_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g\\in P:f\\sim_Dg\\},\\qquad\nQ_D\\coloneqq P/{\\sim_D}\\coloneqq\\{[f]_D:f\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\land|\\mathfrak B|=Q_D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;\nc^{\\mathfrak B}=[\\,i\\mapsto c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\,]_D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad F^{\\mathfrak B}(([\\bar f(j)]_D)_{j&lt;n})\n=[\\,i\\mapsto F^{\\mathfrak A_i}((\\bar f(j)(i))_{j&lt;n})\\,]_D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl((([\\bar f(j)]_D)_{j&lt;n})\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:((\\bar f(j)(i))_{j&lt;n})\\in R^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\}\\in D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书印刷 pp.214–216（DjVu 230–232），集合商构造及定义4.1.6；本地4.2.1b不是书中编号。指标与族载体均非空，选择公理保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(P\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>。已读命题4.1.5、4.1.7的陈述；原书把其证明留作习题，这里补核关键论证：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in D\">\\(I\\in D\\)</span> 给自反性，集合等式给对称性，等值集合的有限交包含于传递所需等值集合。若每个对应代表元在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 中的集合上相等，有限交上的全部坐标相等，故函数结果相等，关系真值集合在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>-大集合上相同。两个子集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>-大集合上相同，则它们同时属于或同时不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>。因此函数与关系均不依赖代表元，且构造唯一确定解释函数。</p>\n<p>载体族作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal A:I\\to V\\)</span> 的值在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathcal P(\\bigcup_i|\\mathfrak A_i|)\">\\(V=\\mathcal P(\\bigcup_i|\\mathfrak A_i|)\\)</span> 中，上游参数顺序与陪域要求已核对；不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> 的实际像集。只对真滤子定义归约积，与书中构造的适用范围一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数