false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A,V,P,\\sim_D,[f]_D,Q_D","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"f\\sim_Dg","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar f\\in P^n","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar f(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A&\\coloneqq\\{(i,|\\mathfrak A_i|):i\\in I\\},\\qquad\nV\\coloneqq\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\\right),\\\\\nP&=\\{f:I\\to\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|:\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in|\\mathfrak A_i|)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V),\\\\\nf\\sim_Dg&\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in D,\\\\\n[f]_D&\\coloneqq\\{g\\in P:f\\sim_Dg\\},\\qquad\nQ_D\\coloneqq P/{\\sim_D}\\coloneqq\\{[f]_D:f\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\land|\\mathfrak B|=Q_D\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;\nc^{\\mathfrak B}=[\\,i\\mapsto c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\,]_D\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\\\\n&\\qquad F^{\\mathfrak B}(([\\bar f(j)]_D)_{j<n})\n=[\\,i\\mapsto F^{\\mathfrak A_i}((\\bar f(j)(i))_{j<n})\\,]_D\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\\\\n&\\qquad\\bigl((([\\bar f(j)]_D)_{j<n})\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:((\\bar f(j)(i))_{j<n})\\in R^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\}\\in D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\mathcal P(\\bigcup_i|\\mathfrak A_i|)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false}],"bytes":3701,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1db681479e4a909","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$ (predicate, see [[17-df-reduced-product]])"},{"id":"3979795456a966f2","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$ (reduced-product predicate, see [[17-df-reduced-product]])"},{"id":"bdee1a47445fb8d1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$ (reduced-product predicate, see [[17-df-reduced-product]])"},{"id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 是同一语言 $L$ 的结构族，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子，谓词见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$、$P$、$\\sim_D$、$[f]_D$ 与 $P/{\\sim_D}$ 见 [[17-df-reduced-product]]；在本节点以 $D=U$ 实例化这些记号，$f\\in P$ 时使用 $[f]_U$。元理论及选择公理假设继承该构造。$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构，以下定义 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$。"},{"id":"4b63c4b193ffc453","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$ and $\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$ (proper filters and reduced products, see [[17-df-filter]] and [[17-df-reduced-product]])"},{"id":"a7bf11e2f518df7b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$ (reduced-product predicate, see [[17-df-reduced-product]])"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-